    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d542-a1">

                <pb facs="0637" n="551" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg551"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Villiers to Mr. Choate.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Foreign Office</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1903-12-16"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">December 16,
                    1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Your Excellency</hi>: With reference to my note of
                    the 24th ultimo, I have the honor to inform your excellency that the lords
                    commissioners of His Majesty’s Admiralty would prefer that the graves recently
                    discovered on Hospital Cay, Guantanamo Bay, Cuba, should remain undisturbed.</p>
                <p>I have at the same time to convey to your excellency the thanks of the lords
                    commissioners for the courteous offer of the American Government to take care of
                    the graves, an offer of which they are most happy to avail themselves.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.</p>
                <p>(In the absence of the Marquis of Lansdowne),</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">F. H. Villiers.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
